      "page_title": "Long-Running Operations and 202 Jobs",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "qa",
          "q": "Q40. How do you design an endpoint for a long-running operation?",
          "a_bullets": [
            "Don't hold the connection open: return ==202 Accepted== with a status URL, and let the client poll or get a webhook.",
            "Create a job resource and give it a state: queued, running, done, failed.",
            "Status URL returns progress; finished jobs link to the result.",
            "Make the start call idempotent with an `Idempotency-Key`."
          ],
          "example_code": [
            "POST /reports -> 202 Accepted",
            "Location: /jobs/42",
            "GET /jobs/42 -> {\"state\":\"running\"}",
            "GET /jobs/42 -> 303 /reports/9"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "headers": [
            "Job state",
            "Status code",
            "Client does"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "queued",
              "200",
              "keep polling"
            ],
            [
              "running",
              "200",
              "poll, honor Retry-After"
            ],
            [
              "done",
              "303",
              "follow to result"
            ],
            [
              "failed",
              "200",
              "show error, retry"
            ]
          ],
          "highlightRow": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "style": "tip",
          "title": "Polling etiquette",
          "text": "Send `Retry-After` so clients back off, allow a DELETE to cancel a job, and expire finished jobs after a day."
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "style": "banner",
          "title": "Key takeaways",
          "text": "Version in the URL path, deprecate with Sunset headers, upload via presigned multipart, and answer slow work with 202 plus a job URL."
        }
      ],
      "hero": "server",
      "subtitle": "Q37 to Q40"
    },
